    <briefdescription>
<para>The PE32 Import Lookup Table. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>There is an array of these for each imported DLL. It represents either the ordinal to import from the target DLL, or a name to lookup and import from the target DLL.</para>
<para>This also happens to be the same format used by the Import Address Table when it is initially written out to the image. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
